<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="d52f9fb5">&lt;p&gt;
    The Communications Plan allows a management team to understand communication requirements, how to structure messages
    and information to appropriate stakeholders through the most effective channels and involve the right people to deliver
    communications at the most opportune time.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The Communications Plan describes:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communication needs and expectations associated with the business solution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        What and how information will be communicated
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        When and where each communication will be delivered
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Who is responsible for developing and reviewing each type of communication
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
